	(text "LT4321 enable (A-bridge-lt4321.md calc 3): on for VPRI >= 32.8 V (D101, R106),\nheld off below 21 V (R107). Q109 pulls EN low whenever the TPS2373 hot-swap is\nopen (RTN-VSS > 2.8 V), so the bridges run only with CBULK connected (LT4321 p.7).\nR108 2.2 M keeps the detection signature at 24.4-24.9 k."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 241.3 120.65 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))
		(uuid "a442d814-f762-4fd3-8980-ba31c4d92b78")
	)
